# Agreement Entry into Force and Transitional Periods

This scope computes the date the agreement enters into force and the end dates for various transitional protection periods.

```catala
declaration scope AgreementEntryIntoForce:
  input notification_date content date
  output entry_into_force_date content date
  output end_date_bunderfleisch content date
  output end_date_union_3yr content date
  output end_date_swiss_5yr content date
  output end_date_union_5yr content date
  output end_date_grana content date
```

## Entry into force

The agreement enters into force on the first day of the second month following the date of the last notification.

```catala
scope AgreementEntryIntoForce:
  date round down
  definition entry_into_force_date equals notification_date + 2 month
```

## Transitional periods for GIs

The scope defines the end dates for various transitional protections based on the agreement's entry into force.

```catala
scope AgreementEntryIntoForce:
  definition end_date_bunderfleisch equals
    entry_into_force_date + 3 year
  definition end_date_union_3yr equals
    entry_into_force_date + 3 year
  definition end_date_swiss_5yr equals
    entry_into_force_date + 5 year
  definition end_date_union_5yr equals
    entry_into_force_date + 5 year
  definition end_date_grana equals
    entry_into_force_date + 6 year
```